The native root cause is now closed in code: Windows venv `python.exe` is a launcher, so the real interpreter became a grandchild and failed the authenticated direct-child check. The worker now launches the already identity-bound base interpreter directly, reports that same process image, and still executes the fixed installed `csk.exe` archive with site disabled. Local unit/mypy gates remain green.
